<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said, I've already told you
everything I know.</font>

32
00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You first met Genno at Ichiraku...</font>

33
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you talk about then?</font>

34
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't remember everything!</font>

35
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what we want to know.</font>

36
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we analyze your conversation,</font>

37
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we might be able to figure out
who hired Genno.</font>

38
00:01:54,090 --> 00:01:56,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We already know all
the conversations</font>

39
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you've had during
the past two weeks.</font>

40
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What we want to know is what
you guys talked about before that.</font>

41
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You tell me that but...
I don't remember.</font>

42
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll put you
under Regressive Hypnosis.</font>

43
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Regressive Hypnosis?</font>

44
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using hypnosis,</font>

45
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can bring out the memory of
the past from your subconscious...</font>

46
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just relax.</font>

47
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back to the Past Jutsu!</font>

48
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's start...</font>

49
00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now you are traveling
through your memories...</font>

50
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:48,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A day ago... two days ago...
three days ago...</font>

51
00:02:49,270 --> 00:02:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep going back into the past.</font>

52
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... it's the day you met
the old carpenter.</font>

53
00:02:56,570 --> 00:02:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you?</font>

54
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside... the forest...</font>

55
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:10,210
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="28">Even the Anbu Give Up</font></font>

56
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:10,210
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="30">Naruto's Memory</font></font>

57
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was training on my own.
And it was lunch time, so...</font>

58
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I headed for Ichiraku...</font>

59
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's where...</font>

60
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You met him not inside
the restaurant, but outside, yes?</font>

61
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what are you doing?</font>

62
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes...</font>

63
00:03:29,270 --> 00:03:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just trying to figure out if
I should go into the restaurant or not.</font>

64
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it any good?</font>

65
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man, you're not from here are you?</font>

66
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:42,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... I'm a freelance carpenter.
How did you know?</font>

67
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because all the Leaf Village people
know that Ichiraku's ramen is the best!</font>

68
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

69
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go! Thanks for waiting!</font>

70
00:03:58,050 --> 00:04:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! This is quite good!</font>

71
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it?!</font>

72
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for this meal!</font>

73
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're already done?</font>

74
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a growing boy!</font>

75
00:04:12,230 --> 00:04:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even an extra large isn't
enough for me!</font>

76
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Then, why don't I give
you some of mine.</font>

77
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Are you sure?</font>

78
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

79
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky!</font>

80
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, old man!</font>

81
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we said goodbye after
we finished eating the ramen...</font>

82
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when did you meet him next?</font>

83
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I met him in front of Ichiraku again...</font>

84
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

85
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing here either...</font>

86
00:05:00,570 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

87
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

88
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

89
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like there were
odor-neutralizing components</font>

90
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in last night's smoke screen.</font>

91
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was quite prepared.</font>

92
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why did he get caught?</font>

93
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:46,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's because our ANBU Black Ops
are really good, right...?</font>

94
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should have known</font>

95
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that our ANBU Black Ops were excellent
before he infiltrated us...</font>

96
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should have had
other escape routes ready.</font>

97
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,
that sounds about right.</font>

98
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But right now,
there's no way to find out.</font>

99
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dead men tell no tales, I see.</font>

100
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here.</font>

101
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?</font>

102
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:20,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're connecting the pieces
of the corpse.</font>

103
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Connecting the pieces...</font>

104
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was in a really awful shape.</font>

105
00:06:26,690 --> 00:06:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From what I hear,
he had Paper Bombs all over his body...</font>

106
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:33,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you like to wait outside
until we're done?</font>

107
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I suppose so...</font>

108
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll stay here!</font>

109
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

110
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're quite impressive...</font>

111
00:06:47,090 --> 00:06:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura.</font>

112
00:06:58,390 --> 00:07:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he gave me eggs and
barbeque pork that time...</font>

113
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's talking about Ramen again.</font>

114
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I remember that time...!</font>

115
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:11,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

116
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He showed me a photograph.</font>

117
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A photograph?</font>

118
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:20,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A photograph of a guy that
looked about my age.</font>

119
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I asked him why
he was so nice to me...</font>

120
00:07:26,340 --> 00:07:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a grandson.</font>

121
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's about the same age as you.</font>

122
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I can't think of you as a stranger.</font>

123
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I look forward to treasure hunting with
my grandson on my days off.</font>

124
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Treasure hunting?</font>

125
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

126
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, you're already done eating?!</font>

127
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll give you some of mine.</font>

128
00:07:55,910 --> 00:07:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, old man!</font>

129
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to your hand?</font>

130
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:05,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... It's a scar from a long time ago</font>

131
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when I accidentally cut myself
with a saw.</font>

132
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then he gave me
his ramen again...</font>

133
00:08:15,260 --> 00:08:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genno has no relatives...</font>

134
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then his story about
his grandson's a lie?</font>

135
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We started marking him the next day.</font>

136
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think any more inquiries are pointless.</font>

137
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess he wouldn't be careless enough</font>

138
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:31,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to leak any information even to a Genin.</font>

139
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:37,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An emergency report
from Tsunade-sama!</font>

140
00:08:44,170 --> 00:08:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... There was nothing unusual
about any of the buildings.</font>

141
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were all built
according to their plans...</font>

142
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were no signs of any traps.</font>

143
00:08:54,050 --> 00:08:58,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So was it just camouflage for him
to sneak in as a carpenter?</font>

144
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too soon to make a judgment on that.</font>

145
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he was just supposed to
steal the plans,</font>

146
00:09:04,230 --> 00:09:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there was no need for him
to be a carpenter.</font>

147
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way,
what were you guys looking up?</font>

148
00:09:11,530 --> 00:09:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We got a list of places where
he used to stop by</font>

149
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from his carpenter buddies,</font>

150
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:18,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we're looking through
all those places,</font>

151
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but so far we haven't found any clues.</font>

152
00:09:20,990 --> 00:09:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there are a lot of restaurants...</font>

153
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Seems like he never
went out besides to go eat.</font>

154
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the meantime, Hinata,
you go see Ino and Sakura</font>

155
00:09:31,210 --> 00:09:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the forensics center.</font>

156
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:35,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji and Choji, you guys go
help Kiba and Shino!</font>

157
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood.</font>

158
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, we should get going too...</font>

159
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

160
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama is calling for you!</font>

161
00:09:49,310 --> 00:09:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Hokage is?</font>

162
00:09:53,780 --> 00:09:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! The Village Hidden
in the Waterfalls?</font>

163
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that they've committed
all their troops into battle position.</font>

164
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're calling it
a big practice run, however...</font>

165
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big practice run...?</font>

166
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think I need to say more, but...</font>

167
00:10:09,330 --> 00:10:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been used many times in the past.
They get all of their troops together</font>

168
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:16,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the purpose of a big practice run
and then invade another country...</font>

169
00:10:18,090 --> 00:10:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, there is information that
Genno stayed in</font>

170
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Village Hidden in the Waterfalls</font>

171
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before coming to
the Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

172
00:10:24,890 --> 00:10:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wouldn't be unusual if there
was some sort of connection.</font>

173
00:10:29,770 --> 00:10:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most of the ninja we've deployed</font>

174
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have already been mobilized
to the Village Hidden in the Waterfalls.</font>

175
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crossing the border will be
taken as a sign of willful invasion.</font>

176
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will attack anyone that enters.</font>

177
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, I want you to
head over to the border, too.</font>

178
00:10:49,790 --> 00:10:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think that there's
a need for us to go.</font>

179
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru?!</font>

180
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean...?</font>

181
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto. Hey, Naruto!</font>

182
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're getting in the way of my business
by standing there!</font>

183
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Sorry.</font>

184
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:17,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that I think about it,</font>

185
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen the old man finish
his ramen...</font>

186
00:11:21,070 --> 00:11:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that he hated ramen?</font>

187
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then why did he come to
Ichiraku all the time?</font>

188
00:11:34,170 --> 00:11:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell us why.</font>

189
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ten Gennin and one Chunin...</font>

190
00:11:40,050 --> 00:11:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our presence or absence won't
make much of a difference</font>

191
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the overall situation.</font>

192
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:44,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is your point...?</font>

193
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like it...</font>

194
00:11:49,350 --> 00:11:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Genno's actions...</font>

195
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the investigation,
I've figured it out...</font>

196
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His everyday activities were
quite impressive...</font>

197
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:01,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His abilities as a carpenter
was average,</font>

198
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was quite plain, never stood out,
and never made any big mistakes</font>

199
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody hated him,
and nobody liked him.</font>

200
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:11,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if he were to disappear
all of a sudden,</font>

201
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no one would think twice
about it the next day...</font>

202
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A very low-key profile.</font>

203
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:21,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an undercover technique
that's so impressive</font>

204
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I'd want to put it
in a Shinobi textbooks.</font>

205
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A brilliant Shinobi like him being marked
by the ANBU Black Ops so easily...</font>

206
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you think that's a bit strange...?</font>

207
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true...</font>

208
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when he was trying to get away...</font>

209
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was able to get away from
the ANBU Black Ops,</font>

210
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they caught up to him.</font>

211
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:46,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a trap professional,
it seems like such a lame end.</font>

212
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of all that, the plans
have completely disappeared.</font>

213
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't make any sense to me.</font>

214
00:12:59,590 --> 00:13:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...?</font>

215
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything is moving
along according to his plan.</font>

216
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It couldn't be...?</font>

217
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His true identity being discovered,</font>

218
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and dying in front of
the ANBU Black Ops...</font>

219
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if all of that was his plan?</font>

220
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if he had predicted that
we would all leave the village</font>

221
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in taking precautions against
the Village Hidden in the Waterfalls...</font>

222
00:13:22,070 --> 00:13:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We could be just dancing on
the palm of his hand.</font>

223
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we look at all the information
we have at this point,</font>

224
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we need to be on alert for
the Village Hidden in the Waterfalls.</font>

225
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true, but...</font>

226
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

227
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think the situation will
change much</font>

228
00:13:41,340 --> 00:13:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just by sending another ten Genin
and one Chunin...</font>

229
00:13:46,130 --> 00:13:50,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have the Shikamaru squad
continue to investigate Genno.</font>

230
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:52,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood.</font>

231
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! Choji!</font>

232
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry... I didn't mean to make you wait.</font>

233
00:14:02,730 --> 00:14:03,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My head hurts...</font>

234
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:07,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey. Why do we have to
look through these books?</font>

235
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to do it either.
But this is the basis of investigation.</font>

236
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still... There're so many numbers,
my eyes are hurting.</font>

237
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:20,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...
I still can't find it.</font>

238
00:14:21,130 --> 00:14:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

239
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

240
00:14:24,090 --> 00:14:26,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The old recommendation letter
that enabled them</font>

241
00:14:26,470 --> 00:14:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to figure out that Genno's
recommendation letter was a fake.</font>

242
00:14:29,970 --> 00:14:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you have to look for that?</font>

243
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a hunch...</font>

244
00:14:34,890 --> 00:14:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did the people of this house just lose it?
Or did he...</font>

245
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In either case,</font>

246
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he should have wanted to get rid of</font>

247
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the recommendation letter
that he brought...</font>

248
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would he just get rid of
the old recommendation letter?</font>

249
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is where he took his own life...?</font>

250
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:58,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that they've already
collected the remains.</font>

251
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a job done by the ANBU Black Ops...</font>

252
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They don't leave anything behind.</font>

253
00:15:05,050 --> 00:15:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone, come over here!</font>

254
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, the tree is burned on both sides!</font>

255
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Paper Bombs exploded...</font>

256
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There should be burn marks.</font>

257
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that it's on both sides
is the problem!</font>

258
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. If it were just a suicide bomb,</font>

259
00:15:19,310 --> 00:15:21,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it wouldn't have left marks on both sides.</font>

260
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There would have to be
at least two explosions</font>

261
00:15:24,650 --> 00:15:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to leave these kind of burn marks.</font>

262
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But according to the ANBU Black Ops,</font>

263
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he exploded the Paper Bombs
that were wrapped around his body.</font>

264
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no one saw him at the moment
of the explosion...</font>

265
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They may be ANBU Black Ops,</font>

266
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they'd still need to dodge
the explosion.</font>

267
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one's burned on both sides too...</font>

268
00:15:52,050 --> 00:15:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same on this tree too.</font>

269
00:15:54,510 --> 00:15:55,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably...</font>

270
00:15:56,010 --> 00:15:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, the Paper Bombs that
were placed on</font>

271
00:15:58,390 --> 00:15:59,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the trees in the surrounding area
were blown up...</font>

272
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then there was a huge explosion
in the center.</font>

273
00:16:05,190 --> 00:16:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he had set off the explosions
close to each other,</font>

274
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it's possible to perceive it
as one explosion!</font>

275
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

276
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in order to do that,</font>

277
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he would have needed to set up
some sort of trick beforehand.</font>

278
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't Genno take his life</font>

279
00:16:17,530 --> 00:16:19,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after being cornered by
the ANBU Black Ops?</font>

280
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:22,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if they didn't catch up to him,</font>

281
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but rather,
he let them catch up to him?</font>

282
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're saying that
he was running away</font>

283
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">planning to let them
catch up to him here?!</font>

284
00:16:31,170 --> 00:16:32,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not impossible...</font>

285
00:16:33,090 --> 00:16:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that is the case...</font>

286
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's possible that he could
have laid other traps.</font>

287
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that...</font>

288
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the fact he killed himself with
the Paper Bombs is also...</font>

289
00:16:46,190 --> 00:16:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's done.
They said you could come in.</font>

290
00:16:49,070 --> 00:16:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

291
00:16:54,070 --> 00:16:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible.</font>

292
00:16:55,490 --> 00:16:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't the ANBU Black Ops make sure
with their own eyes...?</font>

293
00:16:57,870 --> 00:16:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

294
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:03,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point in telling me
to check out the body.</font>

295
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not a Medical Ninja.</font>

296
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I check
and how should I do it...?</font>

297
00:17:12,210 --> 00:17:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

298
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man... He snuck in as
a carpenter right?</font>

299
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. Is there something
that bothers you?</font>

300
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His hand... It's too clean.</font>

301
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My family owns a flower shop,
remember?</font>

302
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been helping out
since I was a kid...</font>

303
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So if I look at a person's hand,
I can tell what kind of job they do...</font>

304
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Carpenter's hands are much more rough.</font>

305
00:17:39,370 --> 00:17:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's no way that a trap
professional's hand would be so clean!</font>

306
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...!</font>

307
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">May I?</font>

308
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

309
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I suspected...</font>

310
00:17:53,090 --> 00:17:55,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no evidence that he's trained
his Chakra Network.</font>

311
00:17:56,050 --> 00:17:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man has never controlled
a Chakra...</font>

312
00:17:58,430 --> 00:17:59,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

313
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people from the medical group
were talking over there.</font>

314
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That they have some questions
about this body...</font>

315
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:07,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person is not a ninja!</font>

316
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reporting! The spearhead of
the Village Hidden in the Waterfalls</font>

317
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is about to reach the borders!</font>

318
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:23,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're fast...
What about our enforcement army?</font>

319
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are gathering currently,</font>

320
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but they're not in position
for battle quite yet...</font>

321
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if they attack even before
we're in position for battle?</font>

322
00:18:33,130 --> 00:18:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case...</font>

323
00:18:34,460 --> 00:18:36,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who would have thought that the
Village Hidden in the Waterfalls would...</font>

324
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing will come of that right now.</font>

325
00:18:39,470 --> 00:18:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once the enemy crosses that river,</font>

326
00:18:41,390 --> 00:18:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we will see that as their intent
to wage war on us,</font>

327
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we will start to attack!</font>

328
00:18:44,890 --> 00:18:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

329
00:19:02,570 --> 00:19:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Academy?</font>

330
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:06,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were no plans for the Academy...</font>

331
00:19:12,170 --> 00:19:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me! Could you help me?</font>

332
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:17,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you call?</font>

333
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:21,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We saw that the Academy had
made some payments last month...</font>

334
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last month?</font>

335
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh this. We did some
reparation work for the Academy.</font>

336
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have the plans for that.</font>

337
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not possible...</font>

338
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's strange...
Where did I put it?</font>

339
00:19:47,990 --> 00:19:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

340
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Above...?</font>

341
00:20:01,970 --> 00:20:03,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Naruto?</font>

342
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

343
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They should show themselves soon...</font>

344
00:20:20,820 --> 00:20:23,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reporting! The Village Hidden
in the Waterfalls spearhead</font>

345
00:20:23,610 --> 00:20:26,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that was closing in on the borders
has started to retreat!</font>

346
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

347
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:31,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like it really was
a practice run...</font>

348
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then where are the stolen plans?!</font>

349
00:20:38,460 --> 00:20:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

350
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Shikamaru's...</font>

351
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are the plans?</font>

352
00:20:48,390 --> 00:20:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

353
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's written in a complex code
so that it's not easily deciphered.</font>

354
00:20:56,690 --> 00:20:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

355
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:04,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are the plans that were stolen
by Genno appearing here?</font>

356
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

357
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">on a checkerboard night</font></font></b></font></font>

358
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">ichimatsu no yoru ni</font></font></b></font></font>

359
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">when the stardust's are rapidly dancing</font></font></b></font></font>

360
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aa mada kaeri takunai to kuchi ni wa dasenai naa</font></font></b></font></font>

361
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I just can't come out and say, "ah, I don't want to go home yet"</font></font></b></font></font>

362
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">omowa seburi terii</font></font></b></font></font>

363
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">suggestively</font></font></b></font></font>

364
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aisubeki kao ni tsuba wo misutaa kuriketto</font></font></b></font></font>

365
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">spat at that beloved face, mister cricket</font></font></b></font></font>

366
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">asekusai suteeji no ue de hikaru toronboon no</font></font></b></font></font>

367
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">the trombone gradually going off-key</font></font></b></font></font>

368
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">picchi ga dandan hazureteitteiru no mo kininaru kedo</font></font></b></font></font>

369
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">while on the sweaty center stage does bug me</font></font></b></font></font>

370
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">sonna koto yori kono nai mune no moyamoya wa sakki</font></font></b></font></font>

371
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">but more importantly, the fuzziness I feel in my undeveloped chest,</font></font></b></font></font>

372
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">nonda koora no sei kashira nee</font></font></b></font></font>

373
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I wonder If it's from that coke I just drank?</font></font></b></font></font>

374
00:22:40,250 --> 00:22:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Students these days,
sure lack civility.</font>

375
00:22:42,170 --> 00:22:43,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They usually do things like
eat potato chips, eat barbeque...</font>

376
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Read manga.
— And eat box lunches.</font>

377
00:22:45,670 --> 00:22:48,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Is eating all you talk about?
— All that loafing?</font>

378
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Well, I mean
the self study hours are for...</font>

379
00:22:49,930 --> 00:22:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— You know?
— No, I don't know.</font>

380
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They devote themselves to training
even though their Sensei is not watching.</font>

381
00:22:53,890 --> 00:22:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Isn't it beautiful?
— Really?</font>

382
00:22:56,730 --> 00:23:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I am moved! I will back up
their training myself!</font>

383
00:23:01,560 --> 00:23:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh?!</font>

384
00:23:03,020 --> 00:23:05,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Missing the Point. The Target is Coming Into View."</font>

